WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.434
Beautiful.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.802
Yeah.

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.637
While it will be easy to spend
the rest of the day relaxing

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:08.208
on this beautiful beach, there's
work to be done underwater.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:11.044
That snapper I just tasted
is exactly what I need

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:13.546
for my big cook, and
legendary local spear

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.782
fisherman Tony is the
man who's going to get

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.084
me within striking range.

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.052
[splash]

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:19.986
OK, captain.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:20.887
I'm gonna follow you.

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:21.888
Which way?

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:25.792
Got you.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:26.826
Over to you, sir.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:33.366
[splash]

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:43.276
I'm a strong swimmer,
but as I'm diving down,

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:45.245
I'm literally being
swept sideways.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:56.556
Tony explains that the fish that
normally swim above the reef

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:59.626
are taking shelter from
the relentless current.

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.862
He dives deep down to
check out some small caves

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.964
where the fish find protection.

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:06.399
I'm not joining
him, because we're

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:09.769
free diving with no
supplemental oxygen.

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:13.606
If I get trapped in one of those
caves, it would be game over.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.276
[music playing]

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:36.529
That's nice.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.230
That's good.

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:38.364
I'll take it.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.199
A crab.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.301
Nice one.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:45.738
A king crab is a great catch,
but I still have my heart

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.674
set on that amazing snapper.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:53.713
OK.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.348
Good luck.

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:57.383
So I think we've
come up with a plan.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.887
Tony goes down into the
cave, flushes them out,

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.355
and it's like a teamwork.

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:04.657
I'm sat on top of it, and
I dive and take them out.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:14.968
OK.

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:16.135
Bingo.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:27.714
I started seeing these fish
scupper underneath that cave.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.849
I took my shot.

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.184
[speargun shooting]

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:34.053
And I got it.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.922
Woo.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.924
Yes.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:41.327
Thank god for that.

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:43.096
Yes.

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:44.797
Nice one.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:45.431
Woo.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:46.499
Finally.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:47.534
That was a big one
down there as well.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.535
Good job, bud.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.469
I got one.

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:50.870
He got two.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:54.807
Teamwork made the dream work,
and now snapper is officially

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:57.710
on my menu for the big cook.

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:00.747
[music playing]

